cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use PATCH, please cite the manuscript and this software."
title: "PATCH Patient-specific Archetypal Treatment-effect Contextualization of Heterogeneity"
abstract: >-
  PATCH is an interpretable contextualized machine-learning framework that estimates a
  context-conditioned treatment-response coefficient model for each episode by factoring the
  coefficient map through a small set of shared archetypes, applied here to drug-response
  heterogeneity in tuberculosis (NIH TB Portals).
authors:
